{"id":1024650,"shortDescription":"Embárcate y únete a las fuerzas coloniales de España, Inglaterra, Francia y los Países Bajos en la lucha por la supremacía del mar Caribe en el siglo XVII. En Port Royale 4 serás el joven y ambicioso gobernador de una colonia, con ganas de aprender para gestionar y convertir este pequeño asentamiento en una atestada ciudad comerciante.","developers":["Gaming Minds"],"publishers":["Kalypso Media"],"categories":["Un jugador","Logros de Steam","Cromos de Steam","Compat. parcial con mando","Steam Cloud","Préstamo familiar"],"releaseDateRaw":"25 SEP 2020","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1024650?t=1770282220","screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1024650/ss_600109d554ef64d204500a58d298b8d5c1d1ca06.600x338.jpg?t=1770282220","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1024650/ss_600109d554ef64d204500a58d298b8d5c1d1ca06.1920x1080.jpg?t=1770282220"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1024650/ss_c874f065be5c0080696f51d670d22e52d49e1ce9.600x338.jpg?t=1770282220","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1024650/ss_c874f065be5c0080696f51d670d22e52d49e1ce9.1920x1080.jpg?t=1770282220"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1024650/ss_dd47fb3f3cf2762dfa0f38e405d1af45224c2b57.600x338.jpg?t=1770282220","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1024650/ss_dd47fb3f3cf2762dfa0f38e405d1af45224c2b57.1920x1080.jpg?t=1770282220"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1024650/ss_07064c700116db5aa34824804d24c12604d45f6d.600x338.jpg?t=1770282220","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1024650/ss_07064c700116db5aa34824804d24c12604d45f6d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1770282220"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.co